<view class="page">
  <view class="hero-card">
    <view class="hero-emoji">📚</view>
    <view class="hero-title">让一本书，遇见更多人</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">书籍漂流 · 让阅读流动起来</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">👋 加入读书群</view>
    <view class="wechat-tip">读书群已超 200 人，无法分享群二维码。请扫下方二维码添加管理员微信，备注「书籍漂流」，会邀你进群。</view>
    <view class="qrcode-wrap">
      <image
        class="qrcode-img"
        src="/images/admin-qrcode.jpg"
        mode="widthFix"
        show-menu-by-longpress
        bindtap="onTapQrcode"
      ></image>
      <view class="qrcode-hint">长按二维码可保存或识别</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">🌊 玩法说明</view>
    <view class="rule-item">
      <view class="rule-num">1</view>
      <view class="rule-text">
        <view class="rule-title">发布一本书</view>
        <view class="rule-desc">拍封面，写上想对下一位读者说的话</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="rule-item">
      <view class="rule-num">2</view>
      <view class="rule-text">
        <view class="rule-title">等待书友申请</view>
        <view class="rule-desc">书友点"我想要"后，会拿到你的微信号</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="rule-item">
      <view class="rule-num">3</view>
      <view class="rule-text">
        <view class="rule-title">微信沟通交接</view>
        <view class="rule-desc">线下面交或邮寄，自由约定</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="rule-item">
      <view class="rule-num">4</view>
      <view class="rule-text">
        <view class="rule-title">继续漂下去</view>
        <view class="rule-desc">读完后再发出，让这本书继续旅行</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer text-muted">
    <view>v 0.1.0 · MVP</view>
    <view>用 ❤️ 让书流动起来</view>
  </view>
</view>
